# A premise the agent asserts about the CLAIM ROW ITSELF.  The row's bindings
# are injected by the evaluator AFTER premise verification, so this is
# premise-false -- an agent cannot certify its own from_version.  (If the two
# ever swapped order, this arm is what would catch it.)
ClaimA comes from GenA.
ClaimA is grounded in a generation G1 if ClaimA comes from the generation.
ClaimA contends for a generation G1 if ClaimA is grounded in the generation.
